        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The Freebuff command-line assistant now correctly identifies when a request fails because the free model was refunded or the hour already ended, instead of mistakenly assuming another device stole your session. This helps users who code with the free assistant at no charge. If this happens to you, you will now see a helpful message telling you to retry your request or pick a different model, rather than being told to restart the entire app.",
