        "acceptedPr": null,
        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Release Freebuff CLI 0.2.20",
        "summary": "Freebuff CLI 0.2.20 ships a split of context compaction into deterministic and model-based paths, gated by the new `usesDeterministicCompaction` cohort check in `common/src/constants/compaction-policy.ts`. The release also consolidates the `base2-fast` agent mode by removing the `fast` variant from `agents/base2/base2.ts` and deleting five associated agent definition files. In `common/src/ads/sponsored-execution-surface.ts`, the sponsored execution surface types were extracted to a new zod-free module to prevent Convex evaluation of the ad schema graph. The `session_superseded` error handler in `cli/src/hooks/helpers/send-message.ts` now distinguishes refunded starts from instance takeovers using `getFreebuffSupersededReason`.",
        "significance": "major",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "The commit diff bumps `freebuff/cli/release/package.json` from version `0.2.19` to `0.2.20`. The release notes list member commits covering `send-message.ts` gate error handling, `agents/base2` mode consolidation, `compaction-policy.ts` deterministic cohort rollout, and `common/src/ads` sponsored execution surface refactoring.",
