        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff CLI 0.2.20 refines how the assistant handles session interruptions and manages internal agent workflows. The CLI now clearly distinguishes why a free session stops, telling you specifically if your session was refunded, if the hour closed, or if another device took over the seat. It also removes a legacy 'fast' agent mode, simplifying how tasks are planned and delegated. Internally, the system shifted several scheduled background jobs to a different infrastructure runner to manage resource limits and audits. Additionally, the release introduces a new tracking system for sponsored ad campaigns that records why tasks fail without storing personal file paths or private data.",
